 J Trop Med Hyg</source><volume>59</volume><fpage>530</fpage><lpage>534</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9790424</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000103-SosaEstani1"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sosa Estani</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Segura</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruiz</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Velazquez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Porcel</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Efficacy of chemotherapy with benznidazole in children in the indeterminate phase of Chagas' disease.</article-title><source>Am J Trop Med Hyg</source><volume>59</volume><fpage>526</fpage><lpage>529</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9790423</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000103-Reyes1"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reyes</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Vallejo</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Trypanocidal drugs for late stage, symptomatic Chagas disease (Trypanosoma cruzi infection).</article-title><source>Cochrane Database Syst Rev</source><fpage>CD004102</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16235350</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="pntd.0000103-LimaeCosta1"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lima e Costa</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Barreto</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Guerra</surname><given-names>HL</given-names></name><name><surname>Firmo</surname><given-names>JO</given-names></name><name><surname>Uchoa</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal/></person-gr